{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Embark on a journey to discover both the world and yourself on a rainy afternoon by the window.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drawing from the heritage of classic games and offering novel, ingenious gameplay, Flexible Jigsaw: Journey presents a unique puzzle experience. Featuring a curated collection of over 100 breathtaking photographic masterpieces, it invites you to appreciate the vast tapestry of our globe and its intricate details. Find solace and fulfillment for your soul through the art of the puzzle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3839580?t=1759310460","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3839580?t=1759310460","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3839580/fad0682a4629a62420ee91049c4a8a2bc1311933/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759310460","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3839580/fad0682a4629a62420ee91049c4a8a2bc1311933/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759310460","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Embark on a journey to discover both the world and yourself on a rainy afternoon by the window.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drawing from the heritage of classic games and offering novel, ingenious gameplay, Flexible Jigsaw: Journey presents a unique puzzle experience. Featuring a curated collection of over 100 breathtaking photographic masterpieces, it invites you to appreciate the vast tapestry of our globe and its intricate details. Find solace and fulfillment for your soul throu